Modifications by Provable Games, based on upstream commit
3d75aee4b3f43cbd932265e7d60201fd5b770397:

  - webaudio-tinysynth.js: removed the GUI panel (canvas display,
    play/seek/volume controls, MIDI file drag-and-drop) and the
    <webaudio-tinysynth> custom element. The WebAudioTinySynth
    JavaScript API is unchanged.
  - webaudio-tinysynth.js: loadMIDI keeps the tempo from MIDI tempo
    events (microseconds per quarter note) as a fractional BPM instead
    of rounding it down to a whole number, so songs play at their exact
    tempo.
  - webaudio-tinysynth.js: added the loopEnd property and setLoopEnd()
    so a looping song can restart on a bar boundary instead of on its
    last event. With loopEnd unset (0) behavior is unchanged.
  - webaudio-tinysynth.js: loadMIDI parses Standard MIDI Files with
    bounded, validated reads. Malformed or unsupported input (format 2,
    SMPTE or zero division, truncation) throws an Error with a code
    (SMF_*) and keeps the previous song.
  - webaudio-tinysynth.min.js and its source map are regenerated from
    the modified source.
  - Demo pages and README updated to use the JavaScript API; tests added.
